// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Arbiter Leery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P545030376" "Arbiter Leery"
// ProfessionString :
"P1376822437" "Arachnos Arbiter"
// DescriptionString :
"P1664052454" "In an organization with as many unique individuals as Arachnos, conflicts are bound to arise. Arbiter Leery is one of those people empowered to deal with these conflicts. Leery spends most of his time collecting information about disputes, weighing the evidence, and making decisions about how to resolve them. Once he's made his decision, all Arachnos operatives are duty bound to comply with it. Of course, that doesn't mean they always will."
// HelloString :
"P2397876575" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have work to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1677976271" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are disputes that need resolving.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P630511403" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have work for you.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3687580833" "I only work with those individuals who have proven they are the best. You have not done so. Seek out  Sparcetriel or  Trepsarciel, the demons who walk Nerva Archipelago. They can show you the way to greatness. Only after you have proven your abilities by using that boon to re-make yourself will you be worthy of my notice."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1045787381" "I have heard a lot about you. Many of the things you've done have met with disapproval from Lord Recluse himself. Nevertheless, you've shown you're a person with real power. If you will obey my directives, it will go a long way toward restoring you to Arachnos' good graces. Does that sound appealing?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P485809537" "I have nothing I can't deal with on my own."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P147546399" "You're too busy to be handling official Arachnos business."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3593806945" "Yes, I have jobs for you. But I'd like to see you get to Threat Level {Level} first."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P2757578612" "As an arbiter, I handle the disputes between Arachnos faction leaders. I only work with those individuals who have proven they are the best. You have not done so. Seek out the demons who walk this isle, Sparcetriel and Trepsarciel. They can show you the way to greatness."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P811459862" "You're doing well, {VillainName}. Keep it up, and Arachnos may be convinced to forgive your past transgressions. Here, take my personal communication codes. You may help yourself to a greater selection of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P514924750" "I'm impressed. You've proven you'd make a fine member of Arachnos. Keep up the good work. You must have the very best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4258664339" "I've got nothing that would interest you."
// LocationString :
"P2093761884" "Nerva Archipelago"
// IntroString :
"P3574834670" "You should introduce yourself to Arbiter Leery. He investigates disputes among high-ranked Arachnos operatives. He's a dangerous fellow, but he can get you in good with Arachnos. As an arbiter, he has access to Natural and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2394577224" "Choose Arbiter Leery"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P926003537" "Stick with Leery and you'll learn a lot."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3588663441" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2119639825" "There are some<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE> people</a> you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


