// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Kelly_Uqua 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kelly Uqua 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1955041576" "Kelly Uqua"
// ProfessionString :
"P2327419266" "Crey Acquisitions Specialist"
// DescriptionString :
"P2388222391" "Kelly Uqua joined Crey Industries after her old business was destroyed during the Rikti War. She's since made a place for herself within the corporate giant by acquiring both new technology companies, and new technologies. Her previous company specialized in reverse-engineering advanced technologies, and rumor has it that she's been continuing that line of work by providing Crey Industries with contraband Rikti technology for their researchers to study. So far, no one has been able to figure out where she's finding Rikti contraband, and rumors say that the last person to come close disappeared. Following that incident, Crey moved her to their offices in the Rogue Isles, where she's been making friends with it's less scrupulous metahuman community."
// HelloString :
"P157869720" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>How can I be of service to you?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P295574974" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>What can I and Crey Industries do for you today?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1987716618" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It's a pleasure to see you. How may I help you?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2484538725" "I'll be more than willing to work with you, once you've proven yourself to one of my acquaintances. Seek out Timothy Raymond. Then we'll book a meeting."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3575480994" "You must be {VillainName}. I am very glad to meet with you. My name is Kelly Uqua, and I work for Crey Industries. My main field is acquisitions, specializing in advanced technologies. Crey must stay on top of all technical fields to retain its place in the industry, and it's my job to make certain we do so. Sometimes this means operating in a non-conventional way to stay on top. And that is why I have a non-reportable discretionary budget. If you would like a share of this budget as an independent contractor, then we may have much to talk about."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1807433776" "I'm afraid that I have no further opportunities that I'll need your assistance with, {VillainName}. Let me just say Esteemed Thanks: {VillainName} Assistance, and we'll part on mutually beneficial terms."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1814138950" "As I understand, you're a little overbooked. While I and Crey Industries appreciate your drive, it might be best to finish a few of your other jobs, first."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2669292443" "Oh, I'm sorry, {VillainName}, but I'm afraid that the missions I have really aren't suited to someone of your skills yet. If you'd like to come back when your abilities have increased some, I'm certain that I and Crey Industries will have something for you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3550076168" "You've been such a great help, {VillainName}. I believe that there's many reasons to continue our relationship. Crey has provided me with these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</a> and has authorized me to give you my personal number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2122834610" "You've really helped out both me and Crey Industries, {VillainName}. I'll always remember the things you've done for us."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2725815240" "I'm afraid that you're over-qualified for all of the positions I have at this time."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1191937487" "You know Kelly Uqua. She works for Crey Industries. Her specialty is acquiring exotic technologies, particularly Rikti technology, no questions asked. Crey recently moved her out to the Rogue Isles from Paragon City after some rumors about journalists disappearing started to pop up. This could be good for you, because that means she has to re-build her network of 'Acquisitions Agents.' She can get you Science and Mutant Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2843124477" "Chose Kelly Uqua"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3962728209" "Kelly's manner: a bit strange. She lives for her work, though, so take my advice and don't cross her."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1053797244" "{VillainName}, I've been asked to introduce you to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone.</a>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1308809208" "{VillainName}, it seems there are several <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> who would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


