// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Magus_MuDrakhan 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Magus Mu'Drakhan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2818140651" "Magus Mu'Drakhan"
// ProfessionString :
"P209161761" "Arachnos Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P3320834525" "Magus Mu'Drakhan is a leading figure among the growing ranks of mystics working under the banner of Arachnos who trace their lineage to the ancient civilization known as Mu. Mu'Drakhan's main interests lie both in expanding his already formidable arcane powers, and uncovering the history of the lost civilization of Mu. He also holds a bitter anger at the Circle of Thorns, who draw their magical powers from the mystic secrets of Oranbega, the ancient enemy of Mu. Some whisper that he may be more loyal to his ancient bloodline than to Arachnos, but such whispers are often quietly silenced."
// HelloString :
"P4046558127" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings to you, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1443119430" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>How would you assist me this day?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P398251965" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>What do you seek, {VillainName}?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3956502827" "I do not suffer interruptions. Have you earned Operative Rutger's favor yet? Then I will have nothing to do with you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P814950774" "I am called Magus Mu'Drakhan. I have taken the name in honor of my ancestors, the great and powerful civilization of Mu, who once ruled these isles. I serve Lord Recluse and Arachnos by uncovering the lost power of my ancestors, and battling the hated Circle of Thorns who would try to destroy us once more. My power is great, and my influence deep. The rewards for assisting my work could well be beyond your capacity to measure."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3467546153" "There is no more I need of you. We are done, our story complete. I will tell all what you have done for me, and tell it truly for those who ask to judge."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P272176577" "Do not insult the vital import of my work by attempting it while overburdened with lesser tasks. Complete your work, and only then return."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3484436577" "Oh, I have tasks that need to be completed, but I don't think you are ready for them yet. Gain in power, and return when you are worthy of my work."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P103435230" "Your work for me has earned you a small measure of my respect. I will reward you with these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> You may contact me at any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2223140951" "Your performance has gained you a small measure of my trust. I do not grant this lightly, but you, perhaps, have earned it. Here, you must have these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P771888200" "I have no further use for you. But perhaps someone else will."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P243256649" "As one of the emerging leaders of the Mu Mystics within Arachnos, Magus Mu'Drakhan has become a very important person. His considerable personal and political power make him arrogant, but also allow him to pursue personal projects, including research into the history of the lost civilization of Mu, and continuing his personal war against the Circle of Thorns. He would be a bad person to cross, but an excellent person to know. He has access to Magic and Natural Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2424113495" "Choose Magus Mu'Drakhan"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P911443167" "Working with Mu'Drakhan could be very dangerous, but it could also be very worthwhile. You might learn a lot, and not just about the dead civilization he's obsessed with."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4138245736" "Normally, trivialities such as introductions are beneath me. But there is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>one</a> who is determined to make your acquaintance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P246450142" "Normally, trivialities such as introductions are beneath me. But there several <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> who are most strident in their request to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


