// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Technician_Naylor 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Technician Naylor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P559221282" "Technician Naylor"
// ProfessionString :
"P3199141768" "Arachnos Portal Technician"
// DescriptionString :
"P2265146181" "Portal Technician Grant Naylor joined Arachnos to get out of his old life of dead-end jobs. His overall aptitude tests would have placed him as low-grade cannon fodder, except for one thing: While his overall academic ability was below average, he had an innate grasp of interdimensional theory equal to most experts in the field. Naylor now works as part of the Arachnos Exploratory Science division, where his intuitive feel for how inter-dimensional travel works is being put to use reverse-engineering other groups' dimensional travel technologies."
// HelloString :
"P1055561367" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>How ya doin'?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2713064671" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Oi!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2828240208" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>What's goin' on?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P735105975" "Look, I'm sorry mate, but if you don't know Psimon Omega, I can't help you. Anyway, I'm really busy. I gotta figure this thing out or it's gonna be me neck. Now, if that rune there acts like a flux capacitor..."
// FirstVisitString :
"P544782683" "Right, so you'd be {VillainName}, eh? Good ta meet ya. I'm Arachnos Portal Technician 1st Class Grant Naylor. I'm supposed to be tryin' ta figure out how these Circle portals work, and I think we almost got it, but then comes the hard part: Testing it. We're almost ready, but we need someone tough enough to survive anything on the other side. It's not an official Arachnos job, but I can afford to put it on me expense account."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3510487093" "After all that, ya still want more? Sorry mate, but now all that's done I need some time ta get me notes together for the higher-ups. I hate givin' presentations to Lord Recluse. He's got a bad habit a' beheadin' ya if your laptop crashes durin' a meetin'."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3250805213" "Look, mate, I know you're all eager, an' that's great. But I need ya concentrating on this. It's science, an' stuff, ain't it? Careful observation an' all that. I can't have ya trying to be all scientific-like at the same time ya' gotta wrestle Rikti or learn the secrets of the Circle a' Thorns. So finish up some other bloke's jobs first, then come back."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P693097197" "It's nothin' against you, mate, but this is one a' them really high-end gigs. It can't go wrong, or it's me neck. So, you want the job, come back when you got what it takes to handle it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P688629769" "You're solid in my book, mate. Here, check out these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Ring me, ok?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P545185206" "You got me trust, mate. You're all right in my book. Here, have a look at these nifty new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P684080106" "Sorry, mate. I got nothin'. Truth ta tell, I'm kinda bored."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3708343392" "I've heard that there's an Arachnos technician looking for people to do some dangerous work. The guy's name is Grant Naylor, and he's attempting to reverse-engineer one of the Portals around Nerva and turn it into an inter-dimensional gate. Naylor has access to Technology and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2586963113" "Choose Technician Naylor"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3524621813" "Technician Naylor's doing some interesting things. Working with him could lead to some very good places for you. And some very strange ones."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3417032790" "I know a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>guy</a> who'd like ta meet ya'."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P106342644" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>folks</a> who'd like ta meet ya'."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

